WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Your booking shows an 80% confirmation chance.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
But 80% does not mean your ticket is confirmed.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.500
First, read the current status for each passenger.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.500
If a row still says WL, it is still a waiting-list result.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.500
RailQ lets you request a separate confirmation estimate for supported bookings.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Use that estimate to plan your alternatives.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.500
And always check the official status before you travel.

